<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0586_T25R0401_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, how’d you get in my house?!\nI KNOW I locked that door.\rBill: Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! Do me a solid and\ntake this EEVEE?\rIt came through when I was messin’\nwith the Wi-Fi. Don’t ask.\rSomebody gotta take care of it, but\nI don’t go outside. Sunlight hurt.\rCan I count on you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0586_T25R0401_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bill: I KNEW you’d come through! You\nthe real deal!\fTake care of it! It’s allergic to\nnothin’!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0586_T25R0401_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got\nthe EEVEE!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0586_T25R0401_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bill: Professor Elm said EEVEE can\nevolve into SEVEN kinds of homies!\rIt’s the most indecisive homie alive.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0586_T25R0401_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Whoa, hold up. You can’t carry\nno more homies.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0586_T25R0401_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh... Now what? I can’t keep it.\nMy mama said no more pets.\fI’m 34.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0586_T25R0401_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bill: I used to experiment with\nteleportin’ stuff.\rThe GTS and Wi-Fi came from my\nteleport machine! I lost a sandwich in\fthere once. Still lookin’ for it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0586_T25R0401_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Give the EEVEE you got\na street name? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0586_T25R0401_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0586_T25R0401_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, you collect homies? My son Bill an\nEXPERT.\rHe just got called to the Trap House\nin Ecruteak. First time he left the\fhouse\fin a year. I’m SO proud.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0586_T25R0401_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Whatever happen, I’m just happy to\nsee my baby. Outside. In the sun.\fFinally.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0586_T25R0401_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Who are you?! Put my remote\ndown. Slowly. Real slow.\rMy big brother Bill made the homie\nStorage System.\rHe still live in the basement.\nGenius and broke. Classic.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0586_T25R0401_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You a Hustler?\rI got a useful number for you.\nIt’s my brother. He NEEDS homies. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0586_T25R0401_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} saved Bill’s number\nin the Pokégear!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0586_T25R0401_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My brother made the homie Storage\nSystem.\rI was gon’ give you Bill’s number... He\ngon’ be sad. He waitin’ by the phone.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0586_T25R0401_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Call my brother and he’ll tell you\nALL about PC Boxes. ALL of it.\fFor like three hours. Bring snacks.</language>
	</row>
</body>
